text My chest hurts.
text What is this pain...?
text @[Tomoya]
text (...)
text Everything keeps changing, except for me.
text That's how it's starting to feel.
text Everything I once loved has turned into plain memories as a brand-new world is built around me.
text Nothing can stay the same forever... Everything keeps changing.
text And... that includes Nagisa.
text Even Nagisa will be swept away by the tides of change, and the two of us will grow further and further apart.
text The pain in my chest came from a premonition that I'd have to face this sadness one day.
text She's so close to me right now, but over time, she'll grow more distant.
text That's why I hug Nagisa tightly.
sound OBT.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text What's the matter, Tomoya-kun?
text As I lie there worried, Nagisa speaks to me with kindness in her voice.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey, Nagisa...
sound OBU.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes...?
text @[Tomoya]
text I really love you. So...
sound OBV.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes, and I love you too.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I can't finish what I want to say.
text "...always be by my side."
text If I put the thoughts into words, they'll be washed away.
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa...
sound OBW.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes...?
text Nagisa faces me... and I kiss her on the lips.
text I do it to keep the two of us together.
music ~
text I use my finger to pull her jaw down and open her mouth.
text I want our connection to go even deeper.
music BGM18B.mp3
sound OBX.aac
